{
  "title": "Old Fashioned Jamaican Cox Apple Onigiri",
  "description": "A traditional Jamaican dish featuring cox apples, shaped into nigiri, perfect for a nostalgic and earthy snack. This vegetarian friendly dish is dense and flavorful.",
