      "amount": "2 cloves",
      "notes": "minced"
    },
    {
      "name": "thyme",
      "amount": "1 tsp",
      "notes": "dried"
    },
    {
      "name": "salt",
      "amount": "1 tsp",
      "notes": "to taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "water",
      "amount": "1 cup",
      "notes": "for cooking rice"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Cook the japanese short grain rice according to package instructions using the water.",
    "In a pan, saute the diced onion and scotch bonnet peppers until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the diced cox apples to the pan and cook until they are tender.",
    "Mix the cooked rice with the apple and onion mixture, and add the dried thyme and salt.",
    "Using wet hands, shape the rice mixture into nigiri shapes.",
    "Serve the onigiri at room temperature or chilled.",
    "Garnish with additional thyme if desired."
  ],
